<item><title>Lesotho Correctional Service shares 2,380 maize bags with farmers</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-correctional-service-shares-2-380-maize-bags-with-dd252f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-correctional-service-shares-2-380-maize-bags-with-dd252f/</guid><category>Lesotho</category><description>The harvest from community fields will also help the service reduce reliance on maize bought to feed inmates across the country.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:04:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ls.jpg" length="31810" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ls.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Lesotho revenue authority awards M45,000 for tax-detection idea</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-revenue-authority-awards-m45-000-for-tax-detection-2dd8fe/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-revenue-authority-awards-m45-000-for-tax-detection-2dd8fe/</guid><category>Lesotho</category><description>Team Dynamic 3.1 won the multinational-tax challenge with a system designed to detect schemes companies use to avoid paying tax in Lesotho.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:03:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-revenue-authority-awards-m45-000-for-tax-detection-2dd8fe/share.jpg" length="42113" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-revenue-authority-awards-m45-000-for-tax-detection-2dd8fe/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
